    "sub_ename": "PYTHON PROGRAMMING AND APPLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將以問題解決為導向來認識 Python 程式語言。Python 是目前廣泛被使用的語言，它的語法簡單卻功能強大，本門課將透過三個應用來認識 Python: 資料分析，繪圖與影像處理、網頁資料節過。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course we apply problem-based learning strategy to guide you learn Python programming. Python is widely applied nowadays since it is simple and powerful. You will learn Python through three applications: data analysis, graphics and image processing, and web crawler design.",
